+- GitHub advisory: https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/security/advisories/GHSA-8f2p-47x3-43mv
+- Debian security tracker: https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-78409
+- Debian Bookworm package: https://packages.debian.org/bookworm/util-linux
